  "notes": "POS back-office 'Orders' screen (Flo). Saturated blue #3248ff used sparingly: active segmented button, active nav item text on pale lavender #e8ebff, selected list row with blue outline and lavender fill. Status pills are soft-tinted rounded-full chips color-coded by state (Pending amber, Preparing blue, Ready green, Unpaid red, Couch table orange). Detail pane footer pairs a solid black Checkout button with a green-outlined Add Item button. Bottom status bar shows staff role, receipt printer connection and 'Shift opened' pill — a POS-specific device/shift status strip. A hidden 'Store diagnostics (for support)' panel is present in the DOM below the fold (likely a drawer opened from Diagnostics & Logs). Live page could not be opened."
